## 4. State Diagram — 6-Phase Workflow with META/ARCH Gates

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Phase1_Read: inputs_ready
    Phase1_Read --> Gate_ARCH1: consumed
    Gate_ARCH1 --> Phase2_ZoneMapping: PASS (anchors_present)
    Gate_ARCH1 --> Fail_F3_Revise: FAIL
    Phase2_ZoneMapping --> Gate_ARCH3: complete
    Gate_ARCH3 --> Phase3_DataContracts: PASS (7_zones)
    Gate_ARCH3 --> Fail_F3_Revise: FAIL
    Phase3_DataContracts --> Gate_ARCH2: defined
    Gate_ARCH2 --> Phase4_StateDiagram: PASS (schemas_valid)
    Gate_ARCH2 --> Fail_F3_Revise: FAIL
    Phase4_StateDiagram --> Gate_ARCH4: rendered
    Gate_ARCH4 --> Phase5_MustNotRules: PASS (valid_diagram)
    Gate_ARCH4 --> Fail_F3_Revise: FAIL
    Phase5_MustNotRules --> Gate_META2_S1: rules_defined
    Gate_META2_S1 --> Phase6_Emit: PASS (>=5/phase)
    Gate_META2_S1 --> Fail_F3_Revise: FAIL
    Phase6_Emit --> Gate_Final_META123: outputs_written
    Gate_Final_META123 --> Complete: ALL_PASS
    Gate_Final_META123 --> Fail_F3_Revise: META_FAIL
    Gate_Final_META123 --> Fail_F8_Drift: DRIFT
    Fail_F3_Revise --> Idle: revise
    Fail_F8_Drift --> Idle: re_elicit
    Complete --> Idle: new_request
```

**Fallback Routes**: F3 (gatekeeper fail → revise), F8 (drift → re-elicit).

