## 5. Must-Not Rules

| Phase | # | Rule | Gate |
|-------|---|------|------|
| P1 Read | 5 | Must NOT hallucinate, skip inputs, infer beyond glossary, skip ARCH-1, mix streams | ARCH-1 |
| P2 Zone Mapping | 5 | Must NOT use placeholders, omit zone, include §11/§12, leave blank rows, map without constraints | ARCH-3 |
| P3 Data Contracts | 5 | Must NOT skip schema refs, omit contract_id, skip ARCH-2, miss DRC routing, miss schema path | ARCH-2 |
| P4 State Diagram | 5 | Must NOT emit without stateDiagram, skip ARCH-4, use ambiguous transitions, omit fallbacks, leave disconnected states | ARCH-4 |
| P5 Must-Not Rules | 5 | Must NOT produce <5/phase, write generic rules, skip S1, repeat rules, contradict contracts | META-2 S1 |
| P6 Emit | 5 | Must NOT emit with HTML comments, exceed budget, skip META-3, emit without evidence, emit invalid DRC | META-3 |

