## 7. Stakeholder Analysis

| # | Stakeholder | Role | Pain Point | Expectation | Success Signal |
|---|-------------|------|------------|-------------|----------------|
| 1 | Production Quality Gatekeeper (S1.5) | Downstream gate — validates design.md | No deterministic gates → manual review | Binary PASS/FAIL gates, schema-valid design | META gates auto-validate |
| 2 | Skill Planner (S2) | Downstream decomposer | Placeholder filenames → cannot decompose | Exact filenames + 7-zone completeness | Every zone row produces at least 1 task |
| 3 | Skill Builder (S3) | Downstream implementer | Missing cognitive context → builds wrong implementation | Dual knowledge stream, zero placeholder | All 7 zones populated correctly |

