## 8. Reverse Questions (Defensive Reasoning)

### S1 Negation Implications
| # | Question | Implication if Ignored | Mitigation |
|---|----------|----------------------|------------|
| 1 | What if only 3 rules per phase instead of 5? | META-2 S1 FAIL | Exactly 5+ per phase required |
| 2 | What if rules contradict each other? | Planner gets conflicting signals | Cross-phase consistency check |
| 3 | What if too specific vs too generic? | Violations slip through or unactionable | Balance: 2 generic + 2 specific per phase |
| 4 | What if downstream overrides rules? | Consistency broken | Downstream adds only, never overrides |

### S2 Design Wrongness
| # | Question | Implication if Ignored | Mitigation |
|---|----------|----------------------|------------|
| 1 | What if exploration.md has wrong SCS? | Wrong architectural pattern | Sanity-check SCS in Phase 1 Read |
| 2 | What if glossary <10 terms passes? | Semantic void propagates to builder | Hard gate: glossary≥10 non-negotiable |
| 3 | What if criteria.md misses critical AC? | Design passes listed criteria but fails real requirement | Independent coverage assessment per zone |
| 4 | What if zone mapping has duplicate filenames? | Planner creates duplicate tasks | Injective mapping check in checklist |

### S3 Stakeholder Harm
| # | Question | Implication if Ignored | Mitigation |
|---|----------|----------------------|------------|
| 1 | What if gatekeeper gets no binary gates? | Manual review bottleneck, 10x slowdown | META-3 enforces binary gate presence |
| 2 | What if planner gets ambiguous filenames? | Task DAG incomplete, builder stalls | ARCH-3 enforces injective filename mapping |
| 3 | What if builder gets zero cognitive context? | Semantic drift, F8 rework | Dual knowledge stream check |
| 4 | What if quality-matrix <80%? | Pipeline blocked, 12-task cluster stalls | Pre-check before emit, F3 revise route |

### S4 Constraint Breaks
| # | Question | Implication if Ignored | Mitigation |
|---|----------|----------------------|------------|
| 1 | What if SKILL.md >700 tokens? | BUILD-3.1 warning, refactor loses semantics | Strict section budget, auto-count before emit |
| 2 | What if schema changes mid-pipeline? | Gatekeeper rejects, all downstream blocked | Pin schema version in frontmatter |
| 3 | What if path resolution breaks (INC-7)? | drc.yaml missing, routing fails | Fallback to direct _shared/ copy |
| 4 | What if downstream expectations change? | Format mismatch | Freeze template at Stage 1, document in §10 |

