## 9. Risks & Mitigation

| # | Risk | Likelihood | Severity | Impact | Mitigation | Contingency |
|---|------|------------|----------|--------|------------|-------------|
| 1 | SKILL.md exceeds 700 tokens | Medium | P1 | Refactor may lose semantics | Section-level budget: frontmatter ≤50t, workflow ≤250t, gates ≤100t | degraded:true + extended version |
| 2 | Upstream input quality insufficient | Medium | P1 | Cannot produce valid design | Phase 1 validation, reject if incomplete | F6 escalate protocol |
| 3 | Template bugs trigger schema violation | High | P1 | False negative blocks pipeline | Fix during build: no §11/§12, ≥3 risks, ≥3 interactions | F3 fallback: revise + re-emit |
| 4 | Cognitive stream insufficient | Medium | P1 | Builder lacks context → drift | IQD threshold: glossary≥10 in knowledge/* | degraded flag + inline exemplars |
| 5 | Degradation path not triggered | Low | P2 | Pipeline hard halts on non-critical failure | Test degradation paths per deployment | Orchestrator escalates with evidence |

